From 22edf28d5e5512469f40334ed687eaa611ba96fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Florence Blanc-Renaud <flo@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:30:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ipatests: remove userspace fake FIPS mode

The steps required for creating a userspace fake FIPS mode
do not work with fedora 45+. Simply remove them as FIPS mode
is tested downstream with a real FIPS configuration.

Fixes: https://codeberg.org/freeipa/freeipa/issues/10055
Signed-off-by: Florence Blanc-Renaud <flo@redhat.com>
Reviewed-By: David Hanina <dhanina@redhat.com>
Reviewed-By: David Hanina <dhanina@redhat.com>
---
 ipatests/pytest_ipa/integration/config.py     |   2 -
 ipatests/pytest_ipa/integration/env_config.py |   2 -
 ipatests/pytest_ipa/integration/fips.py       |  44 ------
 ipatests/pytest_ipa/integration/host.py       |  40 +-----
 ipatests/test_integration/base.py             |  20 ---
 ipatests/test_integration/test_fips.py        | 130 ------------------
 ipatests/test_integration/test_testconfig.py  |   2 -
 7 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 239 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 ipatests/test_integration/test_fips.py

